WEBVTT

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.920
<i>A moment in which a distinct reality was singled out</i>

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:09.760
<i>from the countless possible intertwined truths.</i>

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:35.580
<i>That's what happened when I saw Sanehara Hikari eating lunch, lonely and by herself.</i>

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:45.350
What are you, a stalker?

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.150
Hey, that's mean.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.880
Then why do you keep hounding me?

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.530
Because you make for a good photo subject.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.900
You don't know how to eat a burger, do you?

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.500
What's your problem?

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.540
I have a small mouth.

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:04.320
Let me show you the right way to eat a burger.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.920
First, you do this.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:12.420
That goes against my aesthetic sense.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:16.050
It's hard to take you seriously when you've got ketchup on your cheek.

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:19.470
Not there, the other side.

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:22.540
Then you take it and...

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.980
So good!

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:34.610
So good!

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:37.670
Yuck.

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:41.260
A close encounter of the third kind.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:23.400
The attributive form, "-shi", is actually one lower on the conjugation chart.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:28.310
The attributive "-shi" is part of the family "-se", blank, "-ki", "-shi", "-shika", blank.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.310
The recollective auxiliary conjugation
"-shi" is the only one that makes sense,

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:36.280
and this attributive form is essentially equivalent to the final recollective auxiliary conjugation "-ki".

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.780
Next, then, we have...

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.910
Sanehara, done with gym class?

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.660
Can't you tell?

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:54.420
Good point.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:56.340
Bye.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.000
Uh, wait!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.920
Mind if I take a few photos?

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.140
I don't mind.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:07.430
You really like taking pictures of people, don't you?

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:12.560
And you really like taking pictures of everything <i>but</i> people.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:28.080
Wouldn't you rather take pictures of
someone prettier? Someone with more curves?

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.950
That's not what photography's all about, right?

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:38.460
If you don't mind, could I get one of you smiling?

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:40.840
I <i>do</i> mind.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.380
You don't like smiling?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.160
I don't like having my picture taken, either.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:52.850
Maeda, looks like you're already having trouble.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.600
Too bad, huh?

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.690
Now that I think about it, I don't believe I've ever...

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.400
seen Sanehara smile.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.570
You've been a great help, Maeda-kun. Thank you.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.830
How do you keep getting lost in school?

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.910
Could you just remember the way here already?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.500
I'm sorry.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.580
You know your way back, right?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.170
Um, I just go through the courtyard and—

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.420
The courtyard's the longest way back!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.710
Is that so?

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:27.240
Oh, there was someone from the Photo Club taking pictures in the courtyard.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.180
Don't you have club activities too?

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:31.100
I'm in the <i>Photography</i> Club,

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:34.060
and I'm only here to accompany you.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.620
Right, right.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:36.980
Sorry.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:46.900
I'm surprised.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.400
You only ever take still lifes, but here you are taking pictures of yourself.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.360
It's because you said something stupid.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:56.160
I grew curious about how I looked in photos.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.460
That's the right direction.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.320
Try taking pictures of people, just like that!

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:03.710
I don't like taking pictures of people.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:07.430
You keep saying that.

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:09.660
Why not?

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:15.470
When you point a camera at someone, they smile on reflex.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.230
Right.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:19.260
But that smile is fake.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:22.730
You never know if they're actually smiling in their heart.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:26.240
I don't want to see smiles like those, let alone take pictures of them.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.150
So I won't smile either.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.200
Sanehara...

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.160
Excuse me.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:36.620
Hey!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.120
I'm not hiding anything from you!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.880
I can tell you that for sure!

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:44.100
Yes, you're right.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:48.010
You only act according to your desires and whims.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.800
That hurts...

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.900
The midday moon.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:02.100
You can actually see Mount Fuji from the middle of the city.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.110
Really clearly on sunny days.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:07.610
Wow, it's huge!

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.610
From the other side of the platform, you can see the Sky Tower.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:12.110
Right!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.100
You're bored, aren't you?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.680
No, not at all.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:18.620
I only ever took pictures of people. This is kind of new to me.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.480
Sometimes you'll see funny faces on playground equipment.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:24.630
Vroom, vroom! Yay!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:25.750
Like this one.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.710
Very nice!

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.130
But I like flowers the most.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.140
Especially ones on the side of the road that nobody notices.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.970
Flowers will never betray you.

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.140
Flowers...

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.150
All right!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:48.820
I'm getting Sanehara to take pictures of people no matter what!

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.740
That's what Sanehara said to you?

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:57.680
I was curious why she wouldn't take any pictures of people.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:01.480
Katsumi-san, I want her to take pictures of people.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.830
Not taking pictures of people
because she doesn't like smiles?

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.140
That's just way too sad.

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:09.020
So I'm going to do whatever it takes to change that!

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:12.130
I didn't think you'd be so determined about this.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.300
What can I do to help?

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.480
I'm gonna put on something nice and finish this!

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:18.100
"Something nice"?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.810
Know anyone in the Drama Club?

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:27.740
Sanehara!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.480
I've put on this outfit for your sake!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.160
Wanna take pictures of me?

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:31.560
Wanna take pictures of me?

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:31.920
Wanna take pictures of me?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:32.340
Wanna take pictures of me?

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:32.680
Wanna take pictures of me?

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:33.740
Wanna take pictures of me?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.070
Are you an idiot?

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:38.620
If it'll make you take pictures of people,
then I'll be an idiot or anything you want!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.660
Come on! Take 'em!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.580
Huh?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.280
Did that backfire?

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:44.240
Wait!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.630
I want you to take pictures of people!

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.790
I'll do whatever it takes to make you!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.630
No, thank you.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.880
I'll call you out again soon enough!

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.550
Be ready!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:04.340
<i>Despite having declared that I would call her out again,</i>

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:10.190
<i>no ideas came to mind, and fall eventually turned into winter.</i>

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:14.070
Enjoy your food!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.660
Come again!

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:17.780
It's freezing!

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:24.080
<i>The north wind mercilessly blew at my helpless and shameful self, like some divine punishment.</i>

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.920
Oh, it's Sanehara.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.650
Meow!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.650
So, you take photos of cats too?

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.780
But aren't they animals? Cats, I mean.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.790
I just like the wild aura that stray cats have.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.540
Wild cats, huh?

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.920
I would like your help.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.960
For a Photo Club member?

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.630
I like the idea of them being indebted to us, but...

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.970
Maybe I'll just... destroy your mags.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:19.420
Wha—

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:20.930
You threatening us?!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:25.180
Whisper, whisper whisper whisper.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.600
Panties?!

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.560
Boob glimpses?!

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.690
We might be able to capture <i>those</i>?!

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.820
However, we need full-body costumes.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.440
I know someone who might lend us those.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.150
Uchida, think you could get us
some costumes with a wild feel?

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.740
Don't... think so.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:43.080
Photography Club

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:47.360
I know someone who works events at the amusement park. I'll see what I can do.

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:49.370
Photo Club member! You're forbidden from intruding—

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:52.170
Really?! Thanks!

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:56.800
All right, we'll work together and rock this, meow!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:05.180
<i>Found this pretty unique stray cat in an alley in the shopping district!</i>

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:07.140
<i>It's got this totally wild air about it.</i>

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.180
<i>Come snap some photos! Quick!</i>

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.310
I have only bad feelings about this.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.610
Pretty thorough, aren't you?

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:18.030
I did the same with Nakagawa-senpai.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.600
We need to lure real stray cats.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:24.070
Otherwise, Operation Catman might be adversely affected.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.390
As I expected.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:55.650
Meow!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:58.360
Don't stop there! Come just a little closer!

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:02.910
I've got the perfect view from here!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.790
Got a good shot.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.210
I pray for your success, Maeda-senpai.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:19.590
Meow!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.340
I'm a wild cat, meow!

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:27.350
Come on, snap photos of me!

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:28.600
Don't be shy!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.470
Come on—

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.620
It's a photo opportunity, meow!

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.560
Quick, snap some photos!

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.340
Meow.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.360
Meow.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.320
Meow!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.640
That's dangerous. You should take the head off.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:50.260
My aim is to make you take pictures of me!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.080
Go on, do it, meow!

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.430
I'm laughing too hard to take one even if I wanted to.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.850
I see. Didn't work, huh?

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.730
It was funny, though.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.740
Man, the outside air's great!

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:25.360
It smells inside this thing.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.210
Sorry I'm thirty minutes late, Sanehara.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.380
What?

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.960
What's with that head?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.300
Well...

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.090
I'm late because I couldn't fit this into a bag.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.220
Not my fault.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.730
Kouga Land. Kouga Land.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.400
Okay, I returned it.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.980
You didn't have to take the
trouble of coming here with me.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:06.680
I'm only here out of my appreciation for Katsumi-san.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:09.530
Huh? You put down your stuff?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.500
Sanehara, whoever's able to enjoy this wins.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:23.130
So I'm wasting the money I spent on my ticket?

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.380
What the hell?

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.510
Senpai, don't be so scared.

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:35.560
It's all fake. They're just part-time workers.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.840
Basically, Sanehara,

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:43.900
I'm way in the lead because I'm enjoying this to the fullest!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.070
Is that a challenge?

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.910
Scary!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.220
Look, Sanehara!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.390
It's Mount Fuji!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:15.220
You're right. It's so clear.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:29.020
That was fun.

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:31.490
I haven't screamed that much in a long time.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.240
Are you doing anything after this?

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.080
I dunno.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:43.060
There's this place that I can't go to alone.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.420
Mind coming with me?

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.130
S-Sure.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.880
<i>A place that you can't go to alone...</i>

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:53.000
<i>Sanehara, might that be...</i>

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.930
<i>A place where a guy and girl go to...</i>

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:57.720
<i>Might that be... No way!</i>

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.600
Here?

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.690
I didn't want to come alone at night.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.400
I see.

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.230
Can I borrow your camera?

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:12.740
This place is far from the city lights,

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.200
so the stars should come out nice on film.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.920
Could you press and hold this down?

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.880
It'll keep the shutter open.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.710
Don't let go of it.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:29.880
Maeda-senpai, thanks for everything.

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:34.440
I didn't do anything.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:36.720
You also won today.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.100
I'm a little strange.

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:50.730
I've had this tendency to space out
and daydream ever since I was little.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:54.820
I loved taking pictures of flowers and bugs.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.870
But during my junior year of middle school,

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:03.160
these really noticeable girls in my class suddenly started talking to me.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:10.550
I started to talk a lot about fashion and music, things I wasn't interested in until then.

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:15.630
I hung out a lot, dressed well, and smiled...

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.350
I started to initiate conversations more and more.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:24.260
I was happy that I had so many friends for the first time in my life.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:27.850
I tried my best to fit in with them.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:29.520
But...

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:31.900
But?

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:38.320
To them, I was just this very convenient girl.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:43.580
They simply wanted someone who would make them feel superior.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:46.520
They started ordering me around more and more.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:51.040
It got pretty ridiculous, so I
stopped hanging out with them.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:55.920
Then they started tripping me in the corridors and ignoring me.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.510
That's horrible.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:04.180
Then, one day, one of my classmates lost her wallet.

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:08.020
They found the wallet in my bag.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:10.690
I didn't do it,

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.940
but the teacher had suspected me from the start.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.320
That really did it.

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:22.620
I could hear the derisive laughter
coming from all over the classroom.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:26.780
The girls hated me and the boys were playing along.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:33.760
Their smiles were so different from the ones they showed me at first.

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:39.380
It was as though I'd gotten a peek inside their heads.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:42.180
I felt really, really sad.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:46.060
And that's why you don't like smiles anymore?

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.230
I couldn't trust them anymore.

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.240
Damn it, that's just wrong!

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:52.680
I can't forgive them!

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:55.760
You really are kind, Senpai.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:58.880
You're the first person to get mad at them for me.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.440
I...

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.160
I trust your smile.

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:09.780
I think... that's long enough for the photo.

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:10.670
Okay.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.290
Flowers and stars, huh?

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.920
Sounds like a paradise.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.420
What would you wish for?

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:21.160
On a shooting star.

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:24.560
I like your smile.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:29.560
I can count the number of times I've seen it on one hand...

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.060
but I like your smile.

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:37.920
So I want to see it as many times as there are stars—no, even more than that.

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:40.360
That's what I'd wish for.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:44.410
Senpai, can I take a picture of your smile?

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:46.030
Of course!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:51.000
It'll be my first picture of a person since I started high school.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.840
What would you wish for, Sanehara?

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.140
I'd...

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:07.760
I'd wish for you to smile at me even more.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.680
That's what I'd wish for.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:20.940
It's so warm.

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:55.400
Whoa, sure is getting hot around here!

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:58.380
Taking pictures of each other at point blank?

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.820
It's hot enough already, and
here they are making it hotter!

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.110
Phew! It's <i>hot</i>!

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.910
Let's go to the beach next week.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:10.260
Don't want to?

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:12.640
Then...

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:15.720
Ten o'clock at the bookstore by the station.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:18.020
The bookstore?

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:21.300
That way I can read a book if you show up late.

00:21:22.060 --> 00:21:25.700
It's gonna take some time before you trust me again, huh?

00:23:43.640 --> 00:23:44.960
Muroto Aki.

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:47.220
The greatest prodigy to attend
Kouga Academy since it first opened,

00:23:47.220 --> 00:23:49.400
and once a national-level competitive diver.

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:52.410
A stickler for school rules, serious, and a straight arrow.

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:55.660
Born on January 19. Capricorn. Blood type A.

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:58.200
Figure, slender and tall.

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:01.210
Bust, disappointingly flat.

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:02.210
Maeda!

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:04.660
Unleash the passion hidden within Muroto's heart!

00:24:04.660 --> 00:24:06.210
You're the only one who can!

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:08.780
Eroticism Flash!

00:24:08.780 --> 00:24:11.630
A flat chest is beautiful, too.
